Third-party software included in this repository keeps its own license:

- raylib 5.5 (runtime/raylib): zlib/libpng license, see runtime/raylib/LICENSE
- Vulkan-Headers 1.3.296 (runtime/vulkan): Apache-2.0 or MIT, see
  runtime/vulkan/LICENSE.md
- glslang (runtime/tools/glslang.exe): several licenses, see
  runtime/tools/glslang-LICENSE.txt
